        "spec": {
          "sourcePage": 49,
          "sourceRegion": "Question 6, centred temperature graph below the stem",
          "description": "Unfilled monthly temperature polyline with its title, labelled axes, thirteen alternating month initials and rectangular grid.",
          "mathematics": "Categorical monthly observations traced from the source polyline, not an equation-driven cosine plot. The monthly ordinates are approximate pixel-derived values. The horizontal labels cover January of the first year through January following the second year; the observations end in December of the second year. Two troughs are near 10°C and the highest plateau is near 24°C.",
